1
00:00:00,080 --> 00:00:03,354
Bell: Floor twelve. The roof door. Locked.

2
00:00:04,024 --> 00:00:09,395
ALDER TOWER INTERCOM: Attention, residents. This is The
Last Floor. Part three of three: the roof.

3
00:00:10,065 --> 00:00:12,615
Bell: Forty keys. One opens the roof.

4
00:00:13,285 --> 00:00:14,878
Zara: Floor eleven is pouring out zombies!

5
00:00:15,548 --> 00:00:16,827
Zara: They're one flight behind!

6
00:00:17,497 --> 00:00:19,609
Mrs. Lin: Try the key that says ROOF.

7
00:00:19,729 --> 00:00:20,708
Bell: ...That works.

8
00:00:21,378 --> 00:00:23,029
Omar: Everybody out! Shut it!

9
00:00:23,699 --> 00:00:25,637
Mrs. Lin: Bat through the handles. Done.

10
00:00:26,307 --> 00:00:27,735
Zara: What if the pilot never sees us?

11
00:00:27,855 --> 00:00:29,876
Bell: Then we become impossible to miss.

12
00:00:30,546 --> 00:00:33,448
Bell: Helicopter in five minutes. Signal
in threes.

13
00:00:34,118 --> 00:00:35,471
Omar: My pan is a mirror.

14
00:00:35,591 --> 00:00:37,153
Zara: Your pan IS a plan!

15
00:00:37,823 --> 00:00:40,417
Bell: Rule two. Signal in threes.

16
00:00:41,087 --> 00:00:43,070
Zara: They climbed the outside ladder!

17
00:00:43,740 --> 00:00:45,668
Mrs. Lin: Listen. Rotor blades.

18
00:00:46,338 --> 00:00:48,154
Pip: Mayday! Mayday! Open the door!

19
00:00:48,274 --> 00:00:50,425
ALDER TOWER INTERCOM: ...Please stop
saying that. We are landing.

20
00:00:51,095 --> 00:00:55,522
ALDER TOWER INTERCOM: Part three of three, the end
of The Last Floor. Follow for the next series.

